      "writtenOn": "2025-06-03T18:16:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is actually the API that\u0027s not returning \"best_port\" in pdc_power_mgmt in the reported bugs.\n\nScenario: two chargers are connected, then one is disconnected.\n\n1. Upon disconnecting charger, charge_manager selects a new \"best_port\" and updates PDC power mgmt via `board_set_active_charge_port(new_port)`. \n\n2. `board_set_active_charge_port` posts an event, triggering PDC power management thread to go active, while `charge_manager_refresh` goes to sleep mid function. `charge_port` is now stale.\n\n3.  PDC power management queries this API getting the disconnected port, instead of the `new_port` in step 1, leading to the sink path not getting properly enabled.",
      "parentUuid": "f846ebf3_11abc9f7",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1446,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 1450,
        "endChar": 0
      },
