      "writtenOn": "2025-06-03T18:16:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`charge_manager_refresh` runs as a system hook, which is the lowest thread priority.  Any thread that queries this data while `charge_manager_refresh` is running, may get stale data.  `charge_manager_refresh` interacts with other modules that may cause their threads to wake-up, as described in earlier scenario.",
